{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"নতুনদের বিসিএস প্রস্তুতি (১৫০ দিনে পুরো সিলেবাস)": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x<sup>2 </sup>- 1 = 2x হলে (x<sup>4</sup> + 1)/x<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 6", "option2": "খ) 7", "option3": "গ) 8", "option4": "ঘ) 9", "answer": "1", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,&nbsp;<br />x<sup>2</sup> - 1 = 2x<br />(x<sup>2</sup> - 1)/x = 2x/x<br />x<sup>2</sup>/x - 1/x = 2<br />x - 1/x = 2&nbsp;<br /><br />এখানে,<br />(x<sup>4</sup> + 1)/x<sup>2 </sup>= (x<sup>4</sup>/x<sup>2</sup> ) + (1/x<sup>2</sup>)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> &nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;=(x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> + 2 .x.1/x&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 2<sup>2</sup> + 2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 4 + 2&nbsp;<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 6"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) ।2 - 4x। < 6 অসমতাটির সমাধান কত? ", "option1": "ক) - 2 < x < 1", "option2": "খ) - 2 < x < 2", "option3": "গ) - 1 < x < 2", "option4": "ঘ) - 1 < x < 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "।2 - 4x। &lt; 6&nbsp;<br />= - 6 &lt; 2 - 4x &lt; 6<br />= - 6 - 2 &lt; 2 - 4x - 2 &lt; 6 - 2<br />= - 8 &lt; - 4x &lt; 4<br />= - 8/4 &lt; - 4x/4 &lt; 4/4<br />= - 2 &lt; - x &lt; 1<br />= (- 2)(- 1) &gt; ( - x) (- 1) &gt; 1(- 1)<br />= 2 &gt; x &gt; - 1<br />= - 1 &lt; x &lt; 2"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x + y = - 2, x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 4 হলে x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 6", "option2": "খ) - 6", "option3": "গ) 8", "option4": "ঘ) - 8", "answer": "4", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />x + y = - 2<br />x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> &nbsp;= 4<br /><br />আমরা জানি,<br />বা, (x + y)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy&nbsp;<br />বা, (- 2)<sup>2 </sup>= 4 + 2xy&nbsp;<br />বা, 4 - 4 = 2xy&nbsp;<br />বা, 2xy = 0<br />বা, xy = 0/2<br />বা, xy = 0<br /><br />x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> = (x + y)<sup>3</sup> - 3xy(x + y)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = (- 2)<sup>3</sup> + 3.0.(- 2)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = - 8 + 0<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = - 8"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 1/।3x - 5। > 2 অসমতাটির সমাধান কী হবে? ", "option1": "ক) 11/5 < x < 11/3", "option2": "খ) 11/6 < x < 11/2", "option3": "গ) - 3/2 < x < 11/6", "option4": "ঘ) 3/2 < x < 11/6", "answer": "4", "exp": "1/।3x - 5। &gt; 2<br />বা, ।3x - 5। &lt; 1/2<br />= - 1/2 &lt; 3x - 5 &lt; 1/2<br />= - 1/2 + 5 &lt; 3x - 5 + 5 &lt; 1/2 + 5<br />= (- 1 + 10)/2 &lt; 3x &lt; (1 + 10)/2<br />= 9/2 &lt; 3x &lt; 11/2<br />= 9/2&times; 3 &lt; 3x/3 &lt; 11/2 &times; 3<br />= 3/2 &lt; x &lt; 11/6"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) একটি ট্যাংকের 2/5 অংশ পূর্ণ আছে। যদি ট্যাংকে আরো 16 লিটার পানি দেয়া হয় তাহলে 6/7 অংশ হয়। ট্যাংকে কতটুকু পানি ধরে?", "option1": "ক) 30 লিটার", "option2": "খ) 35 লিটার", "option3": "গ) 39 লিটার", "option4": "ঘ) 42 লিটার", "answer": "2", "exp": "ধরি&nbsp;<br />ট্যাংকে পানি ধরে x&nbsp;<br /><br />প্রশ্নমতে,<br />বা, (6x/7) - (2x/5) = 16&nbsp;<br />বা, (30x - 14x)/35 = 16&nbsp;<br />বা, 16x/35 = 16&nbsp;<br />বা, x/35 = 1<br />বা, x = 35"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x<sup>2 </sup>- 3xy - 40y<sup>2 </sup>কে উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ করলে হবে-", "option1": "ক) (x - 8y)(x - 5y)", "option2": "খ) (x - 8y)(x + 5y)", "option3": "গ) (x + 8y)(x - 5y)", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 8y)(x + 5y)", "answer": "2", "exp": "x<sup>2 </sup>- 3xy - 40y<sup>2&nbsp;</sup><br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 8xy + 5xy - 40y<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;<br />= x(x - 8y) + 5y(x - 8y)<br />= (x - 8y)(x + 5y)"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) m - 1/m = &radic;3 হলে, m<sup>2</sup> - 1/m<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) √3", "option2": "খ) √5", "option3": "গ) √7", "option4": "ঘ) √21", "answer": "4", "exp": "দেয়া আছে,<br />m - 1/m = &radic;3<br /><br />আমরা জানি,<br />(m&nbsp; + 1/m)<sup>2</sup> = (m &nbsp;- 1/m)<sup>2</sup> + 4.m.1/m<br />(m &nbsp;+ 1/m)<sup>2</sup> = (&radic;3)<sup>2</sup> + 4&nbsp;<br />(m &nbsp;+ 1/m)<sup>2</sup> = 3 + 4<br />(m &nbsp;+ 1/m)<sup>2</sup> = 7<br />m &nbsp;+ 1/m = &radic;7<br /><br />m<sup>2</sup> - 1/m<sup>2</sup>&nbsp; = (m &nbsp;+ 1/m)(m &nbsp;- 1/m)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= (&radic;7)(&radic;3)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = &radic;21"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) 3x - 2 > 2x - 1 কে সমাধান করলে হবে- ", "option1": "ক) x > 2", "option2": "খ) x > - 2", "option3": "গ) x > 1", "option4": "ঘ) x > - 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "3x - 2 &gt; 2x - 1&nbsp;<br />3x - 2x - 2 &gt; 2x - 1 - 2x<br />x - 2 &gt; - 1&nbsp;<br />x - 2 + 2 &gt; - 1 + 2&nbsp;<br />x &gt; 1<br />"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x<sup>3</sup> - 6x<sup>2</sup> + 12x - 9 এর সঠিক উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (x - 3)(x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 3)", "option2": "খ) (x - 3)(x<sup>2</sup> - 3x + 3)", "option3": "গ) (x + 3)(x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - 3)", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 3)(x<sup>2</sup> - 3x + 3)", "answer": "2", "exp": "x<sup>3</sup> - 6x<sup>2</sup> + 12x - 9&nbsp;<br />= x<sup>3</sup> - 3.x<sup>2</sup>.2 + 3.x.2<sup>2</sup> - 2<sup>3</sup> - 1<br />= (x - 2)<sup>3</sup> - 1<sup>3</sup><br />= (x - 2 - 1) {(x - 2)<sup>2</sup> + (x - 2)1 + 1<sup>2</sup>}<br />= (x - 3)(x<sup>2</sup> - 2.x.2 + 2<sup>2 </sup>+ x - 2 + 1)<br />= (x - 3)(x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 4 + x - 1)<br />= (x - 3)(x<sup>2</sup> - 3x + 3)"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) কোনো ভগ্নাংশের লবের সাথে 5 যোগ করলে এর মান 2 হয়। আবার হর থেকে 1 বিয়োগ করলে এর মান 1 হয়। ভগ্নাংশটি কত?", "option1": "ক) 2/3", "option2": "খ) 1/4", "option3": "গ) 3/4", "option4": "ঘ) 3/5", "answer": "3", "exp": "মনেকরি,<br />ভগ্নাংশের লব x&nbsp;<br />ভগ্নাংশের হর y&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;ভগ্নাংশটি = x /y&nbsp;<br /><br />১ম শর্তমতে,<br />(x + 5)/y = 2<br />x + 5 = 2y&nbsp;<br />x - 2y = - 5 ...................(1)<br /><br />২য় শর্তমতে,<br />x/y - 1 = 1&nbsp;<br />x = y - 1<br />x - y = - 1................(2)<br /><br />(2)নং - (1)নং &